  "term": "appeal",
  "definition": "In this context, appeal means the quality of something that makes it seem aesthetically pleasing or attractive. The source describes it as an aesthetic response that can apply not only to art, but also to ordinary objects, landscapes, speech sounds, and whole languages.",
